---
id: org.dxos.plugin.lighthouse
name: LighthousePlugin
version: 0.1.0
---

A Composer plugin that is lighthouse's web UI. Lighthouse (an agent that searches the web and keeps what it
finds as an RDF graph) runs outside Composer, as its workspace daemon, and is reached through its API
(`lighthouse-api`). The plugin adds a **Research** object to a space: a goal handed to a lighthouse search
session, shown as the session's chat beside a ranked masonry of what it found. The person steers the agent,
votes on results, adjusts the rating model and reads facets of a result on demand; what they keep is copied
into the space, so it is shared with the space's members and outlives the lighthouse workspace.

This document is drafted in the lighthouse repository and moves to `packages/plugins/plugin-lighthouse` in
the DXOS repository, as its PLUGIN.mdl, when the plugin is built. Lighthouse's own code stays in its
repository.

